    "created_at": "2026-01-22T13:09:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-22T13:09:37Z",
    "body": "I guess this would only work for web-page-initiated `console.log()` (and other logging methods) in the same realm? Exposing browser-origin console messages could leak security-sensitive information.",
